ommended for subtraction; it is not a required input or an execution block.", "scope_alignment": "aligned", "statement_revision_id": "statement-revision:307509c44324bb73bc3d016c:1", "status": "completed", "subject_aligned": true, "support_type": "DIRECT_SUPPORT"}, {"activity_ref": "full-06-v2-01:soupx_manual:24ad5e61617d", "assessment_id": "assessment:30262c83b4ad8e47d175caea", "assessment_method": "offline_source_semantic_review_v1", "assessor_ref": "GPT-6 Astra", "created_at": "2026-09-20T13:01:20.609018+00:00", "evidence_span_id": "evidence-span:2b5b3abdbd3bb26d752ef7b3", "object_aligned": true, "predicate_aligned": true, "rationale": "adjustCounts removes background contamination after the channel contamination level is estimated or specified.", "scope_alignment": "aligned", "statement_revision_id": "statement-revision:b09af933529f6541f2b51c01:1", "status": "completed", "subject_aligned": true, "support_type": "DIRECT_SUPPORT"}], "reference_links": {"1": {"statement_ids": ["statement-revision:e0d49a1d4b5649ba466c36d2:1"], "caution_ids": []}, "2": {"statement_ids": ["statement-revision:a1664463eaa30dbc5a1ba535:1"], "caution_ids": []}, "3": {"statement_ids": ["statement-revision:fdd62a32f1f7811ab193f3da:1"], "caution_ids": []}, "4": {"statement_ids": ["statement-revision:307509c44324bb73bc3d016c:1"], "caution_ids": []}, "5": {"statement_ids": ["statement-revision:b09af933529f6541f2b51c01:1"], "caution_ids": []}, "6": {"statement_ids": [], "caution_ids": ["evidence-gap:4c3364dadc943e4e9129c52d"]}, "7": {"statement_ids": [], "caution_ids": ["evidence-gap:cab33c88e969fce65b4fb8a4"]}}, "identity": "Approved Scientific KG v2", "snapshot_id": "approved-scientific-kg-v2-01", "approved_kg_sha256": "06b6772dac4c17c75e8a52b01d40574ecd992702d5228e7634fa8e20f61638c4", "adapter_called": true, "legacy_kg_consulted": false, "coverage": "approved_scope_qualified", "caution_context": [{"caution_id": "evidence-gap:4c3364dadc943e4e9129c52d", "description": "Empty-droplet thresholds: Nemp examples are evaluated in species-mixing experiments; no global integer threshold or required order is extracted.", "evidence": [{"content_hash": "b6f3fe7d8bb03a06e6d2ffc7e569e29a79c3f732c0cc1bc137e19f04e3f4ac94", "end_offset": 4722, "evidence_span_id": "evidence-span:2e4085a95f94dd84bb75d467", "exact_text": "To estimate the background expression profile we consider all droplets with <Nemp UMIs, which we assume unambiguously do not contain cells. The fraction of background expression from gene g, bg, is then given by, (1)\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
\usepackage{amsmath}
\usepackage{wasysym}
\usepackage{amsfonts}
\usepackage{amssymb}
